  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance and Peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland&apos;s supports civil society&#x2019;s role and voice in strengthening inclusive and equitable social and economic development, specifically in the areas of inclusive governance, gender equality and social accountability. Ireland also supports the strengthening of selected institutions, focusing on free and fair elections, women&#x2019;s leadership role and the protection and promotion of human rights including implementing the recommendations of UN Human Rights/EHRC Joint investigations in Tigray (JIT).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 2: Institutions and processes for democratic governance and peacebuilding are strengthened and more accountable</narrative>
